Have you considered QD-OLED 3440x1440 34” 21:9? There are several RGB Stripe models available now. I know you initially wanted 2560x1440 for the better game performance, and 3440x1440 is not much harder to drive. 

I personally find 21:9 to be the superior aspect ratio for games, productivity and also movies/modern TV (since they’re typically cinema aspect, so black top and bottom bars on 16:9). Only issue can be space, especially when it comes to desk-speaker placement, and that some prefer a completely flat panel.

